cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Bhote Koshi-Trishuli flash flood of 26 August 2026, Rasuwa, Nepal: data and analysis code"
message: "If you use this data package or analysis code, please cite it using the metadata below. The manuscript it supports is 'The Bhote Koshi-Trishuli flash flood of 26 August 2026, Rasuwa, Nepal: warning latency exceeded flood travel time', posted to EarthArXiv at https://doi.org/10.31223/X5HN5H and intended for Natural Hazards and Earth System Sciences."
type: software
